<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 STANDINGS/WEEKEND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 STANDINGS/WEEKEND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Super 12 standings after the third round of matches this weekend (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, points for, points against, bonus points, total points):</p>
<p> Transvaal	     3   3   0   0   115    85    2  14</p>
<p> Auckland		3   2   1   0    90    71    1  11</p>
<p> Natal		   2   2   0   0   110    69    2  10</p>
<p> Waikato		 3   2   0   1    72    70    0   8</p>
<p> Northern Transvaal  3   1   1   1    86   107    2   8</p>
<p> Wellington	    3   1   0   2    99    74    3   7</p>
<p> ACT		     3   1   0   2    86    98    2   6</p>
<p> New South Wales     2   1   0   1    51    41    1   5</p>
<p> Free State	    3   1   0   2    70    72    1   5</p>
<p> Canterbury	    2   1   0   1    27    42    0   4</p>
<p> Otago		   2   0   0   2    72   122    2   2</p>
<p> Queensland	    3   0   0   3    46    73    1   1</p>
<p>Weekend results:Transvaal 47 Otago 29; New South Wales 25 Canterbury 8; Waikato 16 Auckland 26; Free State 35 Queensland 24; Wellington 64 Northern Transvaal 32; Natal 35 ACT 26.</p>
